#: scenario8:scenario8_4D5B1952_FBB7_450D_B213_2EECB2E8B062
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3f2fd0186ef9dc52c1ec44f3b4a6a43b4dd88f228903058809fcd5b5a6eb76c8
#. default-sha256: cc84799b0765460f132a4f58cf3e2ecc22ec764a43aa49d932af2c9576f28990
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4D5B1952_FBB7_450D_B213_2EECB2E8B062"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I remember the Silk Road,⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫stretching out before me as far as the eye can see,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Je me souviens de la route de la soie,⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫qui s’étire devant moi aussi loin que "
"l’œil porte,"

#: scenario8:scenario8_E99D19E3_A167_4F57_A7DA_8791B0F2861E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: aba54943b12a7264cbb3e5fbcc8a5cfce57967ee5be4947a800cd33266609682
#. default-sha256: 2d58eecb1e0c206377aa7d8fd1a6b19950e42668a8f499259697ff2ec3b82818
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_E99D19E3_A167_4F57_A7DA_8791B0F2861E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫clouds of dust wisping across the bare dirt trail."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫des nuages de poussière qui recouvrent le chemin de terre nue."

#: scenario8:scenario8_40E7908F_A47F_49C9_A203_5A99E5B51E79
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c97cba4f917d5c010fdd092f38d07daddc4a879aa183a7a0d0da323ae30dfdcd
#. default-sha256: 90b731692c623a55618a0dcfe71d84715bf19167fab7a6ddfda9fe955dc9f06d
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_40E7908F_A47F_49C9_A203_5A99E5B51E79"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫But beyond that,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Mais à part cela,"

#: scenario8:scenario8_A4526673_F606_486A_B4A8_F455E5DA6B49
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 97e8f8602feecd75b599a1c79b3bb01bb57137a42f8cd817658bddcf03e2fc8a
#. default-sha256: 1a6386168f740e5e266e53a1cf4afd3b9a907e7ae171c1117a564eaf74667e8f
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_A4526673_F606_486A_B4A8_F455E5DA6B49"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I can only clearly remember the last five years or so of my life.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫In my oldest "
"real memory, I was a slave."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫J’arrive seulement à me rappeler clairement les cinq derniers jours, à peu près, de ma "
"précédente vie.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Dans mon plus ancien souvenir, j’étais un esclave."

#: scenario8:scenario8_7A6735AE_C1A9_4B70_B191_D290FCD9996A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ac40a3a960d7642621a019a3f0425399cf1132ecadec744e388465c8f63fa782
#. default-sha256: 73ae8313b915e49ff65fdc1d54b785a358520f7b20b73553556c5c2b60ee68da
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_7A6735AE_C1A9_4B70_B191_D290FCD9996A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You have no idea what that’s like.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫How it feels to be abused and humiliated,⟪k:3⟫"
"desperate for food and water."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Vous n’avez pas idée de ce qu’on ressent.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫À⟪k:4⟫ être maltraité, humilié, à "
"avoir désespérément faim et soif."

#: scenario8:scenario8_B462978E_C7DD_4FDE_A8A9_8D469051BEB8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2b29305c88070c645e93f92f18473f965c56e49140769487d2071ee977b56b3c
#. default-sha256: 8659b6b96041a4352820a8bb125575724d13be704071801af9007c8b84d5baa8
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_B462978E_C7DD_4FDE_A8A9_8D469051BEB8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Oh... ⟪k:1⟫I see.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫So as I was saying..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ah... ⟪k:1⟫Je vois.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Donc, comme je disais..."

#: scenario8:scenario8_5D6BA232_6825_4A00_A986_8F8C0BFDBBE4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0606dc62ea27d91e359294f83fd5a4c38d5434a509634d81484c87bd4b17d9d6
#. default-sha256: d476c34d936a8182bca1aa02cf79dc2e17e2630db91fdfc4cdee983863e7a2ed
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_5D6BA232_6825_4A00_A986_8F8C0BFDBBE4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But they were right about what I was deep down—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫a beast—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫and my revenge "
"went far beyond what could be considered reasonable."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mais ils avaient raison sur ce que j’étais, au fond —⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ une bête —⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫ et ma "
"vengeance dépassa largement le cadre du raisonnable."

#: scenario8:scenario8_F9F2E4D1_B033_4ECD_A2BC_3268A2155534
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 523750f6a7a395b5255377ea484f7b6eb85387c205c17776c90cea12986f0918
#. default-sha256: e3c1d50ac126b8213d02275b6e3d6eca97a2f89207906ad7472065bf01b5b3a0
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_F9F2E4D1_B033_4ECD_A2BC_3268A2155534"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Four years ago,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Il y a quatre ans,"

#: scenario8:scenario8_9737F342_11CF_4BCE_8FD4_F42B0B6D45AF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cc3464e31f3db7d037f1795c7b98d8df0b788a1e595f28f861d37793816c1caa
#. default-sha256: f074a8d7877cf1a39980074e843aa50ccdf34748c252c19825ef282dbdb10a98
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_9737F342_11CF_4BCE_8FD4_F42B0B6D45AF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I was sitting in a carriage as it rattled along a dirt road. ⟪k:1⟫This was not the kind of "
"carriage you rode around town in, but a filthy slave transport."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫je me retrouvai dans un chariot qui cahotait le long d’une route poussiéreuse. ⟪k:1⟫Ce "
"n’était pas le genre de jolie voiture que l’on peut voir en ville, non, c’était un véhicule "
"immonde qui transportait des esclaves."

#: scenario8:scenario8_0D1D9CD2_9C53_41BC_B3F0_18430F2CAD00
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 81536ea20be070f5321742a31a161a9f97b208144f14111f9ce928719b471cf9
#. default-sha256: 53e70badcab41d682f2b5996ab039d3fc0e868c2a8b3c85d97d4251d40d77dc8
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_0D1D9CD2_9C53_41BC_B3F0_18430F2CAD00"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫There were men, young women, and even children.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Everyone wore a look of "
"hopelessness on their faces,⟪k:3⟫and no one had the strength left to resist."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il y avait des hommes, de jeunes femmes, et même des enfants.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ils avaient tous un "
"regard abattu,⟪k:3⟫et personne n’avait plus la force de résister."

#: scenario8:scenario8_1D886E58_66E2_49FB_9D60_309E65564CB9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
