#: scenario8:scenario8_CB719C18_A0B8_4822_B262_1D5E2F25C1D4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a87a12d723214c4e34e3c88aad7b923ddd2c5b7345da99839ca28733ba26c18e
