msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫A single witch’s freedom is all it’ll cost for everyone here to come out happy."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫La liberté d’une seule sorcière contre le bien-être de toute la ville, ce n’est pas "
"cher payé."

#: scenario8:scenario8_60840E14_2AF3_4F9F_8D76_E17EC9638A56
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 92d892388ebfd99b1ddcc1cc0fb1845eb979e302aa990b6a2f260e2d226863bf
